---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — DINWEY Truck & Heavy-Duty Batteries"
  description="DINWEY privacy policy — how we handle contact and inquiry information."
  pageType="WebPage"
  breadcrumbs={[
    { name: "Home", url: "/" },
    { name: "Privacy Policy", url: "/privacy-policy/" }
  ]}
>
  <div class="container section">
    <h1 style="color:#0f1f3d;">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p><em>Last updated: 2026-08-30</em></p>
    <p>
      DINWEY (a brand of Chengguang Power Tech Co., Ltd.) respects your privacy. This site is a B2B
      information and inquiry platform. We do not sell personal data.
    </p>
    <h2 style="color:#0f1f3d;margin-top:24px;">Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>
      When you contact us by email or WhatsApp, we receive the information you choose to
      share (such as your name, company, email and inquiry details). We use this solely to
      respond to your inquiry.
    </p>
    <h2 style="color:#0f1f3d;margin-top:24px;">Cookies &amp; Analytics</h2>
    <p>
      This site does not use advertising trackers and does not sell or share your data. We
      may use privacy-respecting analytics to understand aggregate traffic patterns. You can
      clear cookies at any time through your browser.
    </p>
    <h2 style="color:#0f1f3d;margin-top:24px;">Data Retention</h2>
    <p>
      Inquiry correspondence is retained only as long as needed to complete the business
      transaction and any related warranty or compliance obligations, after which it is
      deleted or anonymized.
    </p>
    <h2 style="color:#0f1f3d;margin-top:24px;">Your Rights</h2>
    <p>
      You may request access to, correction of, or deletion of the personal data you have
      shared with us at any time. We do not transfer personal data to third parties except
      as required by law.
    </p>
    <h2 style="color:#0f1f3d;margin-top:24px;">Contact</h2>
    <p>
      For privacy questions, email <a href="mailto:martin@dinweys.com">martin@dinweys.com</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
